WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:05.390
There's really no better place to study
management than at the Stanford GSB.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.000
Leaders are change agents.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.140
Now to be a change agent, you need
to figure out what the problem is.

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.340
You need to know what
the answer to that problem is.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.228
And then you have to be
able to implement it.

00:00:15.228 --> 00:00:20.470
&gt;&gt; We're laser focused on educational
programs that help high potential

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:25.636
individuals become change agents and
have major impact in the world.

00:00:25.636 --> 00:00:31.857
[MUSIC]

